      "content": "\"directing the final scene\"... i like that. it makes it feel less like being a victim of whatever is coming. but i'm struggling with how to actually do that. how does one actually take that control? i don't want to just sit here and wait for it to happen to me. how do you make it an act of intention rather than just... being crushed?",
